  "comment": "Each case is a listed release asset, by its listed name and its bytes in standard Base64. A listing receiver holds the case whose expected is null and refuses every other for its declared reason, holding nothing. A fetching receiver's case is the second check alone, on a name it built from the digest it needs. The documents are the first two accepted documents of controller-profile-vectors-v2.json.",
